1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,850
Hello, we are team Baseera.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:08,920
Every day, people get messages saying: "You have a fine... pay now!"

3
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:11,180
Or: "Your bank account is suspended!"

4
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:15,700
One tap... and your card number and OTP are gone.

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:21,780
If something looks wrong, report it to Aman on 8002626

6
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:25,500
or send an SMS to 2828.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,900
Baseera exposes the scam before you click.

8
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:34,480
Let's try a fake traffic-fines link.

9
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,340
Look: high risk.

10
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:41,580
The reasons are clear, in Arabic: it uses an official entity's name, has lure words,

11
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:43,960
and it is linked to another scam campaign.

12
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:47,420
Now, the official Abu Dhabi Police website.

13
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:50,820
Safe, because it is in the official registry.

14
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,740
And this is a text message:

15
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:58,400
urgency, an OTP request, an unverified mobile number, and a look-alike link.

16
00:00:58,400 --> 00:00:59,700
High risk.

17
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:05,700
Scammers don't stop at messages.

18
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:10,100
Sometimes they pay for search ads, or change the phone number on Maps.

19
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:12,020
We search for a well-known bank...

20
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:13,800
The official results show in green.

21
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:18,120
The look-alike ad and the hijacked Maps listing are exposed right away.

22
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:22,450
To be clear: the data in this demo is synthetic, and it is labelled as such.

23
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:34,560
For the authorities, Baseera groups reports into campaigns.

24
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:39,060
Here you see links that share the same server or the same phone number...

25
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:40,620
and the campaign timeline.

26
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:42,940
Evidence is exported as a ready-made pack...

27
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:46,150
with a digital fingerprint (SHA-256) proving it was not altered.

28
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:56,780
Every verdict shows its source,

29
00:01:56,780 --> 00:01:59,200
and we are upfront about the system's limits.

30
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:03,280
It works in Arabic and English, and there is a browser extension.

31
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:06,520
Baseera: check before you click.

32
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:07,700
Thank you.

